  m_Text: 'In this gamemode, you launch and try and make it as far as you can, there
    are a lot more planets around so make sure you plan your route well!


    The
    boost is slightly different too which will help you in your journey, tapping/holding
    the right side of your phone will turn your ship right and vice versa.


    The
    further away you get from the Earth the better your score!'
